(4655015, 671941, 17245, '<td valign="top">Nice! I am trying to look in the reflexion of the drop to see how you did the shot. Aquarium? Might have liked it better without the different reflexions though.</td>', 'Nice! I am trying to look in the reflexion of the drop to see how you did the shot. Aquarium? Might have liked it better without the different reflexions though.', '2008-04-23 10:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4655022, 671971, 17245, '<td valign="top">Good composition and light. I would have preferred to not see how you made the water go to "the side" though. Maybe by choosing a bottle that did not have a clear neck at the top, so you would not see the water before it gets out of the bottle.</td>', 'Good composition and light. I would have preferred to not see how you made the water go to "the side" though. Maybe by choosing a bottle that did not have a clear neck at the top, so you would not see the water before it gets out of the bottle.', '2008-04-23 10:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4655027, 671989, 17245, '<td valign="top">I like it. I have always been amazed of how this kind of flower is so radically changed in it''s lifespan. Seeing the picture makes me think about puberty, and the yellow one is way ahead of anyone else :-)</td>', 'I like it. I have always been amazed of how this kind of flower is so radically changed in it''s lifespan. Seeing the picture makes me think about puberty, and the yellow one is way ahead of anyone else :-)', '2008-04-23 10:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
