(4655055, 672169, 17245, '<td valign="top">Shows the greatness of the ocean. Looks like the boats are staying close to each other in fear of being alone in the big world. Horizon perfectly leveled, and that slight arch to it adds to the vastness.</td>', 'Shows the greatness of the ocean. Looks like the boats are staying close to each other in fear of being alone in the big world. Horizon perfectly leveled, and that slight arch to it adds to the vastness.', '2008-04-23 10:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4655070, 671958, 17245, '<td valign="top">I love this !!! It would have been even better with bugs continuing to move at the other side of the branch (going down to the left). That would have made look even more that he is cutting out of line. I guess it''s kind of hard to make them obey you :-)</td>', 'I love this !!! It would have been even better with bugs continuing to move at the other side of the branch (going down to the left). That would have made look even more that he is cutting out of line. I guess it''s kind of hard to make them obey you :-)', '2008-04-23 10:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
