(4655082, 670763, 17245, '<td valign="top">A those were the days. I still remember the shutter sound of my film rebel.<br/>Looks like the film is trying to keep the throne in a last desperate move.<br/>The little piece of film sticking out of the cylinder makes the picture for me. "From Kodak to Kingston", sounds like a good book title about progress.</td>', 'A those were the days. I still remember the shutter sound of my film rebel.Looks like the film is trying to keep the throne in a last desperate move.The little piece of film sticking out of the cylinder makes the picture for me. "From Kodak to Kingston", sounds like a good book title about progress.', '2008-04-23 10:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
