(4655226, 672117, 92320, '<td valign="top">Great idea! I actually stared at this for quite sometime... My bearings were off at first. I love this idea! Truly ODD.</td>', 'Great idea! I actually stared at this for quite sometime... My bearings were off at first. I love this idea! Truly ODD.', '2008-04-23 11:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4655315, 670394, 62925, '<td valign="top">this is a nice photo, but what is odd about it? nothing I can honestly see.<br/>If you were going for the whole "there is one model and one book, so it''s odd" thing. Well it doesn''t work. You can only do that if your model somehow tells the audience that she''s alone, that she''s the odd one out sort of thing, and same idea with the book.<br/> <br/>Again I think it''s a great image, just not for this challenge</td>', 'this is a nice photo, but what is odd about it? nothing I can honestly see.If you were going for the whole "there is one model and one book, so it''s odd" thing. Well it doesn''t work. You can only do that if your model somehow tells the audience that she''s alone, that she''s the odd one out sort of thing, and same idea with the book. Again I think it''s a great image, just not for this challenge', '2008-04-23 12:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4655386, 670252, 108564, '<td valign="top">I like the interesting perspective.  I was getting really bored with seeing all of the photos of flowers for this and the Even II challenge.....but then when I came upon this one, I was actually pleased to see flowers....thanks for doing that!!  I give it a 10!</td>', 'I like the interesting perspective.  I was getting really bored with seeing all of the photos of flowers for this and the Even II challenge.....but then when I came upon this one, I was actually pleased to see flowers....thanks for doing that!!  I give it a 10!', '2008-04-23 12:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4655399, 672082, 108564, '<td valign="top">I really like how you can''t see any of their eyes...it adds a lot i think.  I also like the concept of "odd" in this photo.  Not only are there 3 men, but two have gloves in one spot, one has it in another; two have no suspenders, one does; and the boots on the two men on the left look the same but the one on the right looks different.  I''m sure you realized this in composing the photo, but I wanted to say how much I like the thought that went into it.</td>', 'I really like how you can''t see any of their eyes...it adds a lot i think.  I also like the concept of "odd" in this photo.  Not only are there 3 men, but two have gloves in one spot, one has it in another; two have no suspenders, one does; and the boots on the two men on the left look the same but the one on the right looks different.  I''m sure you realized this in composing the photo, but I wanted to say how much I like the thought that went into it.', '2008-04-23 12:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4655411, 670394, 92844, '<td valign="top">Professionalism, razor-sharp precision, modernity, simplicity, clean lighting, and a good hairstylist. It''s head and shoulders above the rest.</td>', 'Professionalism, razor-sharp precision, modernity, simplicity, clean lighting, and a good hairstylist. It''s head and shoulders above the rest.', '2008-04-23 12:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
