(4655524, 670620, 88204, '<td valign="top">I love the shallow DoF, giving clear focus to one set of feet but showing there''s more where that came from. Nice composition. I like the reflections of the feet on the floor. I like the limited color space as well. Very nice.</td>', 'I love the shallow DoF, giving clear focus to one set of feet but showing there''s more where that came from. Nice composition. I like the reflections of the feet on the floor. I like the limited color space as well. Very nice.', '2008-04-23 13:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4655534, 672089, 88204, '<td valign="top">Looks like an interesting subject. I''m not sure that the "stuff" on the left really adds to it. It''s all kind of jumbled and I don''t know what to make of it. My guess is you took the shot in passing by. I think the shot would be more impactful if you made a personal connection with her which would have allowed you to move in closer and focus on her face, shirt and tattoos. Getting her to look at the camera would also show more of a human connection. I love street shots and I think this one has potential but I''d encourage you to talk with your subjects if you aren''t already. I''m challenging myself with this and finding it much more rewarding when I talk to the person (even though it can be uncomfortable to approach). Sorry to ramble.</td>', 'Looks like an interesting subject. I''m not sure that the "stuff" on the left really adds to it. It''s all kind of jumbled and I don''t know what to make of it. My guess is you took the shot in passing by. I think the shot would be more impactful if you made a personal connection with her which would have allowed you to move in closer and focus on her face, shirt and tattoos. Getting her to look at the camera would also show more of a human connection. I love street shots and I think this one has potential but I''d encourage you to talk with your subjects if you aren''t already. I''m challenging myself with this and finding it much more rewarding when I talk to the person (even though it can be uncomfortable to approach). Sorry to ramble.', '2008-04-23 13:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4655540, 672183, 88204, '<td valign="top">I agree. This is odd. Is that a potato chip and a gorrilla? Nice simple shot with a clear subject.</td>', 'I agree. This is odd. Is that a potato chip and a gorrilla? Nice simple shot with a clear subject.', '2008-04-23 13:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
