(4655549, 671535, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Surprising to see such an empty beach with nothing else on it. Lighting is interesting. Sand dollar is nicely lit, yet based on the sky it doesn''t appear to be natural light. I''m curious to know what the lighting was and why the sky isn''t lighter.</td>', 'Great composition. Surprising to see such an empty beach with nothing else on it. Lighting is interesting. Sand dollar is nicely lit, yet based on the sky it doesn''t appear to be natural light. I''m curious to know what the lighting was and why the sky isn''t lighter.', '2008-04-23 13:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
