(4656429, 671261, 58457, '<td valign="top">I like this (I tend to like geometric abstracts).  I''m wondering if you I would''ve liked it more w/o the bottom inch.  I feel like that white block in the lower right hand corner sort of ends the pattern and without it, it may seem like it could really go forever in each direction, completely messing with the scale and giving the viewer no idea how large the building actually is.</td>', 'I like this (I tend to like geometric abstracts).  I''m wondering if you I would''ve liked it more w/o the bottom inch.  I feel like that white block in the lower right hand corner sort of ends the pattern and without it, it may seem like it could really go forever in each direction, completely messing with the scale and giving the viewer no idea how large the building actually is.', '2008-04-23 21:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
