(4657025, 671228, 6999, '<td valign="top">In purely technical terms, I think you''ll suffer here for a complication of composition. The light (and therefore shadows) is a bit harsh, particularly in the way it reflects from the coloured pill, and the seemingly random angles of the white pills have no harmony to their arrangement. Artistically - well, it comes across as a very simple statement, very contrived, and lacks much subtlety of message, for me. But I''m not known for my ability to second-guess the voters, I suppose ...</td>', 'In purely technical terms, I think you''ll suffer here for a complication of composition. The light (and therefore shadows) is a bit harsh, particularly in the way it reflects from the coloured pill, and the seemingly random angles of the white pills have no harmony to their arrangement. Artistically - well, it comes across as a very simple statement, very contrived, and lacks much subtlety of message, for me. But I''m not known for my ability to second-guess the voters, I suppose ...', '2008-04-24 09:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4657028, 671076, 6999, '<td valign="top">Quite like the effect of this - there''s enough variation here to keep the eye from moving straight on. Perhaps not enough to really entrance, however: there''s no sense of real sharpness to it, no sense of texture, which might have helped your cause.</td>', 'Quite like the effect of this - there''s enough variation here to keep the eye from moving straight on. Perhaps not enough to really entrance, however: there''s no sense of real sharpness to it, no sense of texture, which might have helped your cause.', '2008-04-24 09:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4657032, 672145, 6999, '<td valign="top">Rather bizarre. Too small, oddly lit, the cropping is of course also odd, and a sense of over-sharpening and many jpeg artefacts. One might almost think this had been done on purpose ...</td>', 'Rather bizarre. Too small, oddly lit, the cropping is of course also odd, and a sense of over-sharpening and many jpeg artefacts. One might almost think this had been done on purpose ...', '2008-04-24 09:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4657037, 671895, 6999, '<td valign="top">Sure, with that cheap a sound desk? Still, you were never hoping to sell that story to someone who <i>is</i> a FOH engineer, were you ...</td>', 'Sure, with that cheap a sound desk? Still, you were never hoping to sell that story to someone who is a FOH engineer, were you ...', '2008-04-24 09:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
