(4657201, 671510, 91496, '<td valign="top">Cute -- A little contrived, but very powerful.  It took me a while to figure out what "PPO" stood for (Doh!).  Did you try a lower case "O", then "PPo" may have been more apparent as the inverse "odd"?</td>', 'Cute -- A little contrived, but very powerful.  It took me a while to figure out what "PPO" stood for (Doh!).  Did you try a lower case "O", then "PPo" may have been more apparent as the inverse "odd"?', '2008-04-24 12:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4657202, 670795, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice.  However, looks more like 4 or 5 "U-shapes" to me.  Did you look at other angles other than straight on?  This might have more impact at 30 degrees.</td>', 'Nice.  However, looks more like 4 or 5 "U-shapes" to me.  Did you look at other angles other than straight on?  This might have more impact at 30 degrees.', '2008-04-24 12:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
