(4657300, 671912, 91496, '<td valign="top">Hard to see the challenge here, as I can see 15 or more circles, depending on what I call a circle.  Maybe a close up the four Audi cicles would have had more of a wow factor.</td>', 'Hard to see the challenge here, as I can see 15 or more circles, depending on what I call a circle.  Maybe a close up the four Audi cicles would have had more of a wow factor.', '2008-04-24 14:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
