(4657310, 670165, 71651, '<td valign="top">Really interesting! Did you freeze the Cork in an icecube along with some purple flowers? I like the idea.</td>', 'Really interesting! Did you freeze the Cork in an icecube along with some purple flowers? I like the idea.', '2008-04-24 14:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4657319, 671933, 71651, '<td valign="top">Really pretty but it looks like you had to use the digital zoom to get him that big and in return the picture isn''t very sharp. Either that or the shutter speed wasn''t quite fast enough. Maybe it wold have helped to take the picture with full optical zoom and a fast shutter speed and then cropped the picture to get him this size.</td>', 'Really pretty but it looks like you had to use the digital zoom to get him that big and in return the picture isn''t very sharp. Either that or the shutter speed wasn''t quite fast enough. Maybe it wold have helped to take the picture with full optical zoom and a fast shutter speed and then cropped the picture to get him this size.', '2008-04-24 14:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4657322, 672021, 71651, '<td valign="top">What a funny picture. It''s too bad dpchallenge limits the width of the picture to 640 pixels because I''d like to see it a little big larger.</td>', 'What a funny picture. It''s too bad dpchallenge limits the width of the picture to 640 pixels because I''d like to see it a little big larger.', '2008-04-24 14:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4657326, 672139, 71651, '<td valign="top">I really like this but I wish you would have cropped out the distracting sun flare on the right side and then maybe lowered the exposure a touch to take away some of the blow-out highlights. On the other hand I really like all the textures in the wall, the side lighting, and the blacks.</td>', 'I really like this but I wish you would have cropped out the distracting sun flare on the right side and then maybe lowered the exposure a touch to take away some of the blow-out highlights. On the other hand I really like all the textures in the wall, the side lighting, and the blacks.', '2008-04-24 14:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
