(4658683, 671936, 67152, '<td valign="top">i always find it odd that birds tend to flock together on poles like this.  driving down the highway, we see poles with a hundred birds barely fitting, and then the next pole is completely empty - funny, and odd, thing about birds<br/> <br/>technically - i think the narrow crop really hurts you here - especially with the small 640pixel image - we lose the detail of the birds <br/> <br/>possibly a closer crop with a similar set up - placing the birds off center - would provide the same feel but with a bit more for us as viewers to see and enjoy<br/> <br/>this shot seems more like a snapshot of three birds to complete a taste in some sort of scavenger hunt rather than a photo for a photo challenge</td>', 'i always find it odd that birds tend to flock together on poles like this.  driving down the highway, we see poles with a hundred birds barely fitting, and then the next pole is completely empty - funny, and odd, thing about birds technically - i think the narrow crop really hurts you here - especially with the small 640pixel image - we lose the detail of the birds  possibly a closer crop with a similar set up - placing the birds off center - would provide the same feel but with a bit more for us as viewers to see and enjoy this shot seems more like a snapshot of three birds to complete a taste in some sort of scavenger hunt rather than a photo for a photo challenge', '2008-04-25 08:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
