(4658972, 671867, 67152, '<td valign="top">An interesting interpretation of the challenge and one that could really work great<br/> <br/>from a technical perspective, the fish (the subject of the shot) seems washed out and a bit soft in focus - the focus seems to be much better on the pebbles and glass bowl than on the fish<br/> <br/>my main issue with the shot other than the technical flaws is that i think from the title that you are suggesting that it is ''odd'' for the fish to be out of water.  But, the viewer can clearly see the edge of the tank/ bowl - the reflections created by the glass add bowl and the bright colors of the ''pebbles'' adds some charm to the shot.   therefore, it seems to lose its connection to ''oddness''.  if you were going for an odd number instead, i think it would meet the challnege</td>', 'An interesting interpretation of the challenge and one that could really work great from a technical perspective, the fish (the subject of the shot) seems washed out and a bit soft in focus - the focus seems to be much better on the pebbles and glass bowl than on the fish my main issue with the shot other than the technical flaws is that i think from the title that you are suggesting that it is ''odd'' for the fish to be out of water.  But, the viewer can clearly see the edge of the tank/ bowl - the reflections created by the glass add bowl and the bright colors of the ''pebbles'' adds some charm to the shot.   therefore, it seems to lose its connection to ''oddness''.  if you were going for an odd number instead, i think it would meet the challnege', '2008-04-25 12:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
