(4659087, 671851, 67152, '<td valign="top">these smoke shots always look so cool - the patterns and chaotic, yet controlled, nature of the smoke is very engaging.  that said, there appears to be some noise issues with this shot - minor but visible.  i prefer the smoke shots that seem smoother and more continuous</td>', 'these smoke shots always look so cool - the patterns and chaotic, yet controlled, nature of the smoke is very engaging.  that said, there appears to be some noise issues with this shot - minor but visible.  i prefer the smoke shots that seem smoother and more continuous', '2008-04-25 13:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
