(4659134, 671969, 67152, '<td valign="top">energy, enthusiasm, joy, friendship, love, and fun - all things i get when viewing this image</td>', 'energy, enthusiasm, joy, friendship, love, and fun - all things i get when viewing this image', '2008-04-25 13:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659135, 672155, 67152, '<td valign="top">a very different take on Lady Liberty - i like the harshness of the shadows and light - it works nicely in silhoutte<br/> <br/>I don''t see liberty as being odd though - maybe I don''t understand the connection to the theme</td>', 'a very different take on Lady Liberty - i like the harshness of the shadows and light - it works nicely in silhoutte I don''t see liberty as being odd though - maybe I don''t understand the connection to the theme', '2008-04-25 13:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659137, 671949, 67152, '<td valign="top">extreme macros like this are like little puzzles for our eyes - the grain only accentuates the sense of mystery</td>', 'extreme macros like this are like little puzzles for our eyes - the grain only accentuates the sense of mystery', '2008-04-25 13:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659138, 672189, 67152, '<td valign="top">the crossing angles of the leaves and the richness of the colors are the highlights here<br/> <br/>the softness of the focus on teh main subject is the main issue i see</td>', 'the crossing angles of the leaves and the richness of the colors are the highlights here the softness of the focus on teh main subject is the main issue i see', '2008-04-25 13:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659139, 671981, 67152, '<td valign="top">butterflies make the best subjects for macros like this - they tend to hang out and not dart around too much - good colors on the flowers <br/> <br/>i just wish there was a bit more emphasis of the light on the butterfly itself - but boy is that nice and sharp!</td>', 'butterflies make the best subjects for macros like this - they tend to hang out and not dart around too much - good colors on the flowers  i just wish there was a bit more emphasis of the light on the butterfly itself - but boy is that nice and sharp!', '2008-04-25 13:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659142, 671618, 67152, '<td valign="top">the colossium sure brings out the strangest people and other ''things''<br/> <br/>i love how the stick figure sticks out and people really aren''t noticing him<br/> <br/>it seems that the image is quite a bit underexposed - something that a bit of levels adjustment could do wonders with</td>', 'the colossium sure brings out the strangest people and other ''things'' i love how the stick figure sticks out and people really aren''t noticing him it seems that the image is quite a bit underexposed - something that a bit of levels adjustment could do wonders with', '2008-04-25 13:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659144, 671945, 67152, '<td valign="top">excellent studio macro - the light is really well controlled, the spices seem to be so rich in tones adding to the metaphor of food in a direct way</td>', 'excellent studio macro - the light is really well controlled, the spices seem to be so rich in tones adding to the metaphor of food in a direct way', '2008-04-25 13:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659146, 672197, 67152, '<td valign="top">the color metaphor is a good choice for ''odd-ness''.  i am just not sure i like the choice of angle of shot and composition</td>', 'the color metaphor is a good choice for ''odd-ness''.  i am just not sure i like the choice of angle of shot and composition', '2008-04-25 13:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659151, 671857, 67152, '<td valign="top">it is odd how statues don''t drink more - all they do is sit around all day<br/> <br/>when i first opened the thumb, i didn''t see the cup and actually had to go looking for it<br/> <br/>personally, i just find this an unusual and odd image and that is how i find this meets the challenge</td>', 'it is odd how statues don''t drink more - all they do is sit around all day when i first opened the thumb, i didn''t see the cup and actually had to go looking for it personally, i just find this an unusual and odd image and that is how i find this meets the challenge', '2008-04-25 13:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659153, 670785, 67152, '<td valign="top">the angled reflections of the trees and grasses is visually interesting - the extremely blown out tennis ball is just a bit unfortunate - it is actually hard to tell what it is</td>', 'the angled reflections of the trees and grasses is visually interesting - the extremely blown out tennis ball is just a bit unfortunate - it is actually hard to tell what it is', '2008-04-25 13:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659155, 671261, 67152, '<td valign="top">wonderful visual gymnastics image - a bit of a puzzle for our eyes to grasp and relate to reality - i like it a lot</td>', 'wonderful visual gymnastics image - a bit of a puzzle for our eyes to grasp and relate to reality - i like it a lot', '2008-04-25 13:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659158, 671263, 67152, '<td valign="top">what a freaky and odd looking plant - it clearly meets the challenge on the oddness factor - a bit dark for my taste - i almost wonder if it would not do better a bit closer in so we could see more detail in the shot</td>', 'what a freaky and odd looking plant - it clearly meets the challenge on the oddness factor - a bit dark for my taste - i almost wonder if it would not do better a bit closer in so we could see more detail in the shot', '2008-04-25 13:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
