(4659162, 672006, 67152, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors, textures, tones, and rich warmth of light<br/> <br/>subtle connection to the challenge, but i see it - i hope others do as well</td>', 'beautiful colors, textures, tones, and rich warmth of light subtle connection to the challenge, but i see it - i hope others do as well', '2008-04-25 13:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659165, 671849, 67152, '<td valign="top">they sure look like they are having fun...or are going to be having fun...<br/> <br/>the backlighting is a bit extreme and tends to wash over the faces of the subjects a bit too much, making this shot seem more of snapshot than anything else</td>', 'they sure look like they are having fun...or are going to be having fun... the backlighting is a bit extreme and tends to wash over the faces of the subjects a bit too much, making this shot seem more of snapshot than anything else', '2008-04-25 13:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659168, 671852, 67152, '<td valign="top">a poetic and poignant take on the challenge</td>', 'a poetic and poignant take on the challenge', '2008-04-25 13:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659169, 671768, 67152, '<td valign="top">blue angels - gotta love those guys!  I wish the corners of the wings were not cut off - it really loses a lot of impact without the tips of the wings</td>', 'blue angels - gotta love those guys!  I wish the corners of the wings were not cut off - it really loses a lot of impact without the tips of the wings', '2008-04-25 13:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
