(4659176, 671912, 67152, '<td valign="top">you made me look!  funny stuff -but I actually see 7 circles - the wheel, 4 on the audi sign, and two surronding the wheel, and then i guess there are the 10 small circles around the audi sign....but at least it is still odd.<br/>not an award winning shot - a bit busy with the parallel lines and blown out background, but it meets the challenge</td>', 'you made me look!  funny stuff -but I actually see 7 circles - the wheel, 4 on the audi sign, and two surronding the wheel, and then i guess there are the 10 small circles around the audi sign....but at least it is still odd.not an award winning shot - a bit busy with the parallel lines and blown out background, but it meets the challenge', '2008-04-25 13:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659179, 672122, 67152, '<td valign="top">a bit of a mystery to me - the rather in your face centered composition makes me look, but the softness of the focus makes me wonder there to look</td>', 'a bit of a mystery to me - the rather in your face centered composition makes me look, but the softness of the focus makes me wonder there to look', '2008-04-25 13:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
