(4659181, 670996, 67152, '<td valign="top">yummy stuff, sushi - the lighting is a bit harsh for my taste on a food shot - the shadows seem to overwhelm the subject</td>', 'yummy stuff, sushi - the lighting is a bit harsh for my taste on a food shot - the shadows seem to overwhelm the subject', '2008-04-25 13:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659182, 670620, 67152, '<td valign="top">splendid quiet image - the focus on the toes is great and the placement of the two behind are in such good concert</td>', 'splendid quiet image - the focus on the toes is great and the placement of the two behind are in such good concert', '2008-04-25 13:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659187, 670299, 67152, '<td valign="top">funny shot - it is odd how we always expect certain to look a certain way<br/> <br/>the shot seems a bit underexposed and the tight crop in the vertical direction makes it seem a bit too closed</td>', 'funny shot - it is odd how we always expect certain to look a certain way the shot seems a bit underexposed and the tight crop in the vertical direction makes it seem a bit too closed', '2008-04-25 14:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659190, 670654, 67152, '<td valign="top">i wonder what the artist was thinking about when he/she made the sculpture - an odd friendship<br/> <br/>it clearly meets the spirit of the challenge, but this image seems more like checking off an object from a scavenger hunt rather than finding and presenting a photo as art in a photography challenge</td>', 'i wonder what the artist was thinking about when he/she made the sculpture - an odd friendship it clearly meets the spirit of the challenge, but this image seems more like checking off an object from a scavenger hunt rather than finding and presenting a photo as art in a photography challenge', '2008-04-25 14:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4659192, 672196, 67152, '<td valign="top">the colors are so intense and gorgeous - what a great backyard - the carpet of petals looks so good<br/> <br/>the title is the main connection i have to the concept of odd - but it works okay for me</td>', 'the colors are so intense and gorgeous - what a great backyard - the carpet of petals looks so good the title is the main connection i have to the concept of odd - but it works okay for me', '2008-04-25 14:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
