(4660806, 671905, 5364, '<td valign="top">This flower has the potential for a very interesting image, but here you''ve got some of it in direct sun and some in the shadow. The background clutter doesn''t help either. I''d recommend re-visiting it when the lighting is more helpful and maybe bringing something to use as a background.</td>', 'This flower has the potential for a very interesting image, but here you''ve got some of it in direct sun and some in the shadow. The background clutter doesn''t help either. I''d recommend re-visiting it when the lighting is more helpful and maybe bringing something to use as a background.', '2008-04-27 08:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4660808, 672145, 5364, '<td valign="top">You could have done with less harsh lighting, and entering a much larger image</td>', 'You could have done with less harsh lighting, and entering a much larger image', '2008-04-27 08:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
