(4662787, 672171, 76430, '<td valign="top">Excellent creative illusion.  I assume the pan is on a very tilted white board or on the wall.  The lighting is harsh.  If we could see the pan handle end without it being on a hook it would be nice.  Also, if you could manage to stick a pat of butter to the middle of the pan, and maybe smear some more around it to give the appearance of it being level it would be nice.  A nicer effect would be a side angle showing the egg being dropped at an angle.</td>', 'Excellent creative illusion.  I assume the pan is on a very tilted white board or on the wall.  The lighting is harsh.  If we could see the pan handle end without it being on a hook it would be nice.  Also, if you could manage to stick a pat of butter to the middle of the pan, and maybe smear some more around it to give the appearance of it being level it would be nice.  A nicer effect would be a side angle showing the egg being dropped at an angle.', '2008-04-28 12:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4662794, 672153, 76430, '<td valign="top">I don''t see Odd in this one.  I''m sure you''re proud of your baby, but this may not be the right challenge.  Maybe Maybe if he/she was doing something really funny or strange.</td>', 'I don''t see Odd in this one.  I''m sure you''re proud of your baby, but this may not be the right challenge.  Maybe Maybe if he/she was doing something really funny or strange.', '2008-04-28 12:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
