(4663076, 670539, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like your title. Once I read the title, I can easily imagine this little bird about to plunge into the water, the only place where it can sing. Sometimes I wonder if I am an underwater songbird who has wasted too much time flying because I didn''t know what I was.</td>', 'I like your title. Once I read the title, I can easily imagine this little bird about to plunge into the water, the only place where it can sing. Sometimes I wonder if I am an underwater songbird who has wasted too much time flying because I didn''t know what I was.', '2008-04-28 14:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4663082, 672018, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the image, lots of great lines interacting with light. The coathanger certainly is odd in this context, and also balances the composition.</td>', 'I like the image, lots of great lines interacting with light. The coathanger certainly is odd in this context, and also balances the composition.', '2008-04-28 14:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
