(4663118, 671895, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the obscure reference to Def Leppard''s one-handed drummer. I like the lighting. The composition is a little too stable for my taste, though.</td>', 'I like the obscure reference to Def Leppard''s one-handed drummer. I like the lighting. The composition is a little too stable for my taste, though.', '2008-04-28 15:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
