(4665919, 671762, 4967, '<td valign="top">cute :-) took me a second to get it.</td>', 'cute :-) took me a second to get it.', '2008-04-29 21:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665921, 672137, 4967, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image :-)</td>', 'Beautiful image :-)', '2008-04-29 21:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665928, 672191, 4967, '<td valign="top">definitely an odd photo :-) odd trio - love the guy with his one sleeve up one down, the way you cut off their heads, the number. Weird for sure... but I kind of like it :-) I''m wondering whether you took the photo this way... or cropped it to fit the challenge? If you took it this way - kudos to you for prethinking the image. -8-</td>', 'definitely an odd photo :-) odd trio - love the guy with his one sleeve up one down, the way you cut off their heads, the number. Weird for sure... but I kind of like it :-) I''m wondering whether you took the photo this way... or cropped it to fit the challenge? If you took it this way - kudos to you for prethinking the image. -8-', '2008-04-29 21:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665932, 671807, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like this idea a lot... very cool :-) The only thing that''s bothering me a bit... is I think the image looks tilted a tad - I think it would have more impact if you cropped it so that from the curtain looked straighter and perhaps crop just a tad off the black, left side, and a bit of white. -8-</td>', 'I like this idea a lot... very cool :-) The only thing that''s bothering me a bit... is I think the image looks tilted a tad - I think it would have more impact if you cropped it so that from the curtain looked straighter and perhaps crop just a tad off the black, left side, and a bit of white. -8-', '2008-04-29 21:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665933, 671852, 4967, '<td valign="top">burn odd number... burn :-p</td>', 'burn odd number... burn :-p', '2008-04-29 21:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665939, 672117, 4967, '<td valign="top">cute :-) good concept</td>', 'cute :-) good concept', '2008-04-29 21:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665947, 670394, 4967, '<td valign="top">beautiful portrait... nicely lit! However I do not get the huge white frame... I really think it detracts from this image (although it pushes it slightly more into the challenge topic.) but the photo should convey odd and not the frame.</td>', 'beautiful portrait... nicely lit! However I do not get the huge white frame... I really think it detracts from this image (although it pushes it slightly more into the challenge topic.) but the photo should convey odd and not the frame.', '2008-04-29 22:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665954, 672007, 4967, '<td valign="top">Your image is making be dizzy LOL. Great colors :-)</td>', 'Your image is making be dizzy LOL. Great colors :-)', '2008-04-29 22:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665955, 671510, 4967, '<td valign="top">fun take on the classic water drop image. Good stuff :-) well done. -9-</td>', 'fun take on the classic water drop image. Good stuff :-) well done. -9-', '2008-04-29 22:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665978, 672183, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like this image... a lot... however I can not stand the frame... I don''t understand why people insist on adding frames for a photo contest... a picture should be judged as the straight image - and yes I know this is allowed... but that''s my strong opinion... sorry for the rant...<br/> <br/>That being said, I think this image definitely did not need the added photoshop fakeness as it is a wonderful photo on it''s own... -9- I probably would have added it to my favorites without the frame.</td>', 'I like this image... a lot... however I can not stand the frame... I don''t understand why people insist on adding frames for a photo contest... a picture should be judged as the straight image - and yes I know this is allowed... but that''s my strong opinion... sorry for the rant... That being said, I think this image definitely did not need the added photoshop fakeness as it is a wonderful photo on it''s own... -9- I probably would have added it to my favorites without the frame.', '2008-04-29 22:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665984, 672192, 4967, '<td valign="top">Love the three women in this image... the hand is a bit blown out... but I like the image as a whole - nicely done! 8</td>', 'Love the three women in this image... the hand is a bit blown out... but I like the image as a whole - nicely done! 8', '2008-04-29 22:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665990, 671941, 4967, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how you did this... but it''s pretty cool :-)</td>', 'I''m not sure how you did this... but it''s pretty cool :-)', '2008-04-29 22:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4665993, 672091, 4967, '<td valign="top">Definitely odd</td>', 'Definitely odd', '2008-04-29 22:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666003, 671905, 4967, '<td valign="top">weird... the red behind it detracts I think (the flower pot?) and I would have liked to have seen the top of the flower. very odd though :-)</td>', 'weird... the red behind it detracts I think (the flower pot?) and I would have liked to have seen the top of the flower. very odd though :-)', '2008-04-29 22:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666007, 672038, 4967, '<td valign="top">hehe this one made me chuckle :-) thank you.</td>', 'hehe this one made me chuckle :-) thank you.', '2008-04-29 22:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666103, 672189, 83313, '<td valign="top">good, though a bit grainy.</td>', 'good, though a bit grainy.', '2008-04-29 22:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666108, 671747, 83313, '<td valign="top">What a look!</td>', 'What a look!', '2008-04-29 23:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666111, 671906, 83313, '<td valign="top">Could have benefited from deeper DOF, but the front one is nice and clear.</td>', 'Could have benefited from deeper DOF, but the front one is nice and clear.', '2008-04-29 23:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666114, 671942, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very creative. A contender for a Posthumous or an Oobie, or some recognition like that.</td>', 'Very creative. A contender for a Posthumous or an Oobie, or some recognition like that.', '2008-04-29 23:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666125, 671176, 83313, '<td valign="top">A great shot, but you hurt it with some excessive JPEG compression. Your file is about 2/3 the size it could have been and it shows. Quite a bit of stair stepping is visible on the glasses as well. Try a different resizing algorithm to possibly smooth that out a bit. The shot is really good, and I''ll probably be the only one to leave such criticisms on an otherwise outstanding entry.</td>', 'A great shot, but you hurt it with some excessive JPEG compression. Your file is about 2/3 the size it could have been and it shows. Quite a bit of stair stepping is visible on the glasses as well. Try a different resizing algorithm to possibly smooth that out a bit. The shot is really good, and I''ll probably be the only one to leave such criticisms on an otherwise outstanding entry.', '2008-04-29 23:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666128, 672190, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like an explosion. The b/w treatment shows of the patterns nicely, instead of bright colors being the focus of the image. Good work.</td>', 'Looks like an explosion. The b/w treatment shows of the patterns nicely, instead of bright colors being the focus of the image. Good work.', '2008-04-29 23:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666133, 671689, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice and smooth. The person is a good touch that adds the right thing to what would otherwise be a good, bu ordinary sunset.</td>', 'Nice and smooth. The person is a good touch that adds the right thing to what would otherwise be a good, bu ordinary sunset.', '2008-04-29 23:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666137, 671969, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot and concept. The background is a bit cluttered, however.</td>', 'Interesting shot and concept. The background is a bit cluttered, however.', '2008-04-29 23:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666140, 670763, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well done all around. Can''t find much wrong here. Everything is spot-on.</td>', 'Well done all around. Can''t find much wrong here. Everything is spot-on.', '2008-04-29 23:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666142, 670793, 83313, '<td valign="top">Hope he''s at least getting cozy with a girl bird. Cute, but a snapshot, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Hope he''s at least getting cozy with a girl bird. Cute, but a snapshot, I''m afraid.', '2008-04-29 23:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666143, 672060, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and clarity here.</td>', 'I like the perspective and clarity here.', '2008-04-29 23:17:34.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4666145, 672166, 83313, '<td valign="top">Hope there''s an explanation of how you did this in the notes. I''m curious, especially since I see a validation sticker.</td>', 'Hope there''s an explanation of how you did this in the notes. I''m curious, especially since I see a validation sticker.', '2008-04-29 23:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666147, 671263, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting post processing effect. I like the texture and color. A large version would make a neat desktop image.</td>', 'Interesting post processing effect. I like the texture and color. A large version would make a neat desktop image.', '2008-04-29 23:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666153, 670230, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice texture and perspective on this.</td>', 'Nice texture and perspective on this.', '2008-04-29 23:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666160, 670299, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to make of this. I''m afraid it just does not have much impact or appeal to me. Some better lighting and a closer perspective could have made an interesting pattern.</td>', 'Not sure what to make of this. I''m afraid it just does not have much impact or appeal to me. Some better lighting and a closer perspective could have made an interesting pattern.', '2008-04-29 23:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666161, 671516, 50695, '<td valign="top">Perfect processing to isolate this figure and make the surroundings obscure. I get a Surreal sense of alienation. Great shot.<br/> <br/>Best In Show. <br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'Perfect processing to isolate this figure and make the surroundings obscure. I get a Surreal sense of alienation. Great shot. Best In Show.  ', '2008-04-29 23:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666162, 670804, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very cool. And it''s got the always helpful water drops. Nicely done.</td>', 'Very cool. And it''s got the always helpful water drops. Nicely done.', '2008-04-29 23:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666164, 671807, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s odd in several ways, but I''m afraid it''s not working for me. I do think there are some folks that will like this, however.</td>', 'It''s odd in several ways, but I''m afraid it''s not working for me. I do think there are some folks that will like this, however.', '2008-04-29 23:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666165, 672122, 50695, '<td valign="top">you did a good job of isolating the ear in the composition, creating a disorienting effect. not only that, an aesthetically pleasing composition as well.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon. <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'you did a good job of isolating the ear in the composition, creating a disorienting effect. not only that, an aesthetically pleasing composition as well. Posthumous Red Ribbon. ', '2008-04-29 23:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666166, 671857, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is perhaps the oddest picture in the challenge.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'This is perhaps the oddest picture in the challenge. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. ', '2008-04-29 23:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666167, 670925, 83313, '<td valign="top">A little overprocessed, but I like the result.</td>', 'A little overprocessed, but I like the result.', '2008-04-29 23:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666168, 672087, 50695, '<td valign="top">Strange, disorienting... just plain odd. Well done.</td>', 'Strange, disorienting... just plain odd. Well done.', '2008-04-29 23:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666173, 671149, 83313, '<td valign="top">Stark and bold. I really like the way you kept the sunset colors restrained and subtle. It''s always tempting to crank the colors up. An 8 and a fave.</td>', 'Stark and bold. I really like the way you kept the sunset colors restrained and subtle. It''s always tempting to crank the colors up. An 8 and a fave.', '2008-04-29 23:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666176, 671828, 83313, '<td valign="top">The b/w is effective for this. I think it enhances the cracks in the glass.</td>', 'The b/w is effective for this. I think it enhances the cracks in the glass.', '2008-04-29 23:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666183, 672139, 83313, '<td valign="top">A snapshot, I''m afraid. The composition is decent, but the shot lacks sharpness and the white balance seems off. The backlighting is a problem as well. If this were taken at another time of day it would have likely been much improved.</td>', 'A snapshot, I''m afraid. The composition is decent, but the shot lacks sharpness and the white balance seems off. The backlighting is a problem as well. If this were taken at another time of day it would have likely been much improved.', '2008-04-29 23:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666186, 671213, 83313, '<td valign="top">Silly Meerkats, he''s still there...</td>', 'Silly Meerkats, he''s still there...', '2008-04-29 23:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666189, 672145, 83313, '<td valign="top">I hope this is a brown ribbon effort. If it was not, I will be happy to take the time to explain what is wrong here, after the challenge.</td>', 'I hope this is a brown ribbon effort. If it was not, I will be happy to take the time to explain what is wrong here, after the challenge.', '2008-04-29 23:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4666202, 670962, 83313, '<td valign="top">A great shot. I love the perspective and colors. I have a major critique however, and I will likely be the only one to notice it.<br/> <br/>Your file size is only 47k when you could have used up to 150k. This indicates a lot of JPEG compression, which is taking a lot of detail out of your photo. I can clearly see compression artifacts in the sky around the edges of the cowling and propeller. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor and always try to save as close to the limit for a challenge as you can get it without going over. the photo itself is still great and it gets a 7 from me, but would have been an 8 or 9 without the compression problem.</td>', 'A great shot. I love the perspective and colors. I have a major critique however, and I will likely be the only one to notice it. Your file size is only 47k when you could have used up to 150k. This indicates a lot of JPEG compression, which is taking a lot of detail out of your photo. I can clearly see compression artifacts in the sky around the edges of the cowling and propeller. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor and always try to save as close to the limit for a challenge as you can get it without going over. the photo itself is still great and it gets a 7 from me, but would have been an 8 or 9 without the compression problem.', '2008-04-29 23:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
