(4666642, 671941, 64929, '<td valign="top">Congrats on yet another brilliant shot, my dear friend!!  And as the comment <br/> <br/>"This is a glass ball (not a water droplet) and 1 is an odd number, hence the title Oddball. Contrary to your arrogant comment, it most certainly does fit the challenge. <br/>Maybe, after the two years youve been here, its time to put your energy into actually entering a challenge. I wish you luck!" <br/> <br/>- all I can say is YOU GO GIRL!!  He made a really RUDE comment on my "Odd" entry as well.  Just steams me....<br/> <br/>But you ROCK!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-04-30 01:04:47.</i></td>', 'Congrats on yet another brilliant shot, my dear friend!!  And as the comment  "This is a glass ball (not a water droplet) and 1 is an odd number, hence the title Oddball. Contrary to your arrogant comment, it most certainly does fit the challenge. Maybe, after the two years youve been here, its time to put your energy into actually entering a challenge. I wish you luck!"  - all I can say is YOU GO GIRL!!  He made a really RUDE comment on my "Odd" entry as well.  Just steams me.... But you ROCK!', '2008-04-30 02:03:15.000000', '2008-04-30 02:04:47.000000', 0),
