(4689299, 672068, 39427, '<td valign="top">Yeah I mean people like lydia are accustomed to a certain style that they stick with and judge everything accordingly.  I''m not totally ''into'' this sort of stuff but I would never vote anything down the way that at least 50 people seem to have spitefully done on this pic.  This photograph isn''t perfect (I think maybe the lighting and colors could be less harsh and background is drab, unless thats what you were going for...) but it has a lot of other merits where if the subject was a kid pointing a bat or lollipop or something, voters would swoon all over it.  Don''t get down on that, if you get at least one fave it means you''ve touched someone and thats what matters.</td>', 'Yeah I mean people like lydia are accustomed to a certain style that they stick with and judge everything accordingly.  I''m not totally ''into'' this sort of stuff but I would never vote anything down the way that at least 50 people seem to have spitefully done on this pic.  This photograph isn''t perfect (I think maybe the lighting and colors could be less harsh and background is drab, unless thats what you were going for...) but it has a lot of other merits where if the subject was a kid pointing a bat or lollipop or something, voters would swoon all over it.  Don''t get down on that, if you get at least one fave it means you''ve touched someone and thats what matters.', '2008-05-08 01:18:38.000000', NULL, 0),
